; village_bell_tower.room - the bell tower, an interior behind the square's door (design 04 section 3.1), 1x4 screens.
; A slim stone shell (inner faces x 192 and 448) in void; the helix stair (@, systems/helix-stair) turns around Ivo as he
; rides up its axis (x 320) from the bell floor (row 45) through the plank gallery (row 10). Retorno gate: the alcove
; ledge (row 4, cols 12-13) is 6 cells above the gallery, a double jump; the alcove is left empty for the collectible.

